IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ACCOUNT-ELIGIBILITY.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-AGE PIC 9(3).
01 WS-VERIFY PIC X.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    ACCEPT WS-AGE.
    ACCEPT WS-VERIFY.

    IF WS-AGE >= 18 AND WS-VERIFY = "Y"

        DISPLAY "ELIGIBLE"

    ELSE

        DISPLAY "NOT ELIGIBLE"

    END-IF.

    STOP RUN.
